{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08033","headline":"双燕离 · 李白","name":"双燕离","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"双燕复双燕，双飞令人羡。\n玉楼珠阁不独栖，金窗绣户长相见。\n柏梁失火去，因入吴王宫。\n吴宫又焚荡，雏尽巢亦空。\n憔悴一身在，孀雌忆故雄。\n双飞难再得，伤我寸心中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08033.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08033","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}